        "Title": "HOW TO USE  -  1st run: leave the file empty -> <project>_ROOMS.xlsx is made next to the .rvt from the Revit rooms\nThen Browse... to that Excel.  One row per room: LEVEL, NUMBER, NAME, DEPARTMENT, finishes, TARGET AREA m2.  Save + close, Run.\nExisting rooms are updated, new rows become unplaced rooms (Architecture > Room > pick it from the list).  Run again: actual area, DIFF % and STATUS written back.",
